WEBVTT

1
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:13,560
Snowy night, what are you going to do?

2
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:26,870
Not an underground river

3
00:00:26,870 --> 00:00:29,450
It was exposed because of the earthquake just now.

4
00:00:29,450 --> 00:00:34,580
Oh, that's all

5
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:36,460
I can only go and take a look

6
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:38,250
Hope it's not a trap
